itting easy until  the clock hit zero yeah but i think you  have to have that mentality because you  like you just don't go yeah they can't  do that and and it's aaron rodgers i  mean there are a couple of quarterbacks  where you just can't go yeah that's not  possible and and i think that's a good  mindset we're talking to kirk cousins  vikings quarterback uh two touchdowns in  week one no turnovers  by the way more importantly  uh the vikings go to philadelphia next  week that'll be spicy all right we uh  we're we're trying to come up with a bet  on the yellow plaid shirt you had on  yesterday after the game all right  so we want to guess the brand  of the yellow plaid shirt  that kirk cousins had on yes pauline i  know kirk's wardrobe in style pretty  well  i've been tracking it for years okay you  know he's a sensible shopper yeah he you  know got the big contract i'm gonna go  patagonia lovely  okay uh fritzy i'm gonna go hollister  hollister  seton  i'm gonna go ll bean all right marv  i'm gonna go eddie bauer oh that's a  good guess i'm gonna go rei  all right and i wish i wish it was l.l  bean or eddie bauer maybe that fits my  brand a little more but my wife dresses  me by the way  it happened to be patagonia and uh  sitting around the house yesterday about  11 30 before heading to the stadium  and i said uh because i do nothing in  fashion i make no decision so i looked  at my wife and i said have you laid my  outfit out on the bed of the game  and she said no i got to go do that so i  i finished my lunch and then went up  there and sure enough that shirt and a  pair of pants and a pair of socks and a  pair of shoes was sitting right there on  the bed next to the bed and i put it on  and got in the car and headed the  stadium so i just do what she tells me  there's been a few moments where i uh i  shake my head i said there's no way i  should wear this no way  and she says wear it and then adam felin  and justin jefferson and kj osborne look  at me and say